        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"3ea2c617-5867-4f2e-bfee-1430601630a4\",\"review_text\":\"They removed basic features such as Rewind, replay song , they REMOVED UNSHUFFLE , and what ? alAdded all of these basic features for any music App to premium ? Spotify is destroying itself . Remove the update and it may survive but it is the end of sloitfy now , it's on life support P.s if anyone hasn't updated Spotify yet , DONT STAY AWAY FROM UPDATING UT\"},{\"review_id\":\"38a32c3e-29b4-437e-bfe5-db6c64ed90cd\",\"review_text\":\"I give 2 🌟 because when I open my Spotify premium it's downloading\"},{\"review_id\":\"9d99b8ff-d27c-45d2-9d16-54002a5675b5\",\"review_text\":\"Hay vãi\"},{\"review_id\":\"5826e72a-68a4-47d4-bfce-0214a6dd02ee\",\"review_text\":\"I'm so Proud of Spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"04573fd8-f0e3-4ca0-850a-f60e85e7dc9b\",\"review_text\":\"this is good but ads are annoying\"},{\"review_id\":\"eef730de-4cc3-43e8-aa59-57883f8cf8db\",\"review_text\":\"Best app to listen music\"},{\"review_id\":\"7855d300-7a54-4cc9-ad0c-7cbd619829e0\",\"review_text\":\"Mugi Lathi ~♥~😍~♥~\"},{\"review_id\":\"1690ab81-78a9-4ab3-b950-e0f72240aa8b\",\"review_text\":\"This app came pre-installed on my Samsung Note...was great during the trial (24 days) and went from 5 to 1 stars thereafter. It's as good as listening to a random radio station without a premium account. Nothing great about it 🤷\"},{\"review_id\":\"8454f126-3062-4222-a1ca-115176930074\",\"review_text\":\"Would love to see que history in the android app as well as PC! When I'm on my PC I like to listen to music while playing games and sometimes the game is so intense I need to look back at what I've been listening to, which makes that feature very helpful. Unfortunately I can't do the same with the app... Hoping for an update soon!\"},{\"review_id\":\"d888db65-be43-410d-b281-b15da18477fb\",\"review_text\":\"Dress and undress\"}]}"
